# Seeded design canvases are 2.5 MB build artifacts; keep only the sources
/design/**/plando-see-*.html

# Local submission drafts. Everything under output/ is a build product and stays
# out of the tree — renders, staging copies, capture crops.
#
# Two exceptions, added 2026-09-11. The reason this directory was ignored was
# that the deck and the brief still carried a pending five-day result, and
# `git add -A` must not sweep binaries in ahead of the real numbers. That result
# landed, and both files now carry it.
#
# The brief could be rebuilt from tools/build_architecture_pdf.py, so tracking it
# is only convenience. The deck cannot: it was generated inside a Codex runtime
# against a version-pinned plugin path, so there is no build step here that
# reproduces it, and it has hand-applied changes on top. For that file, the
# binary is the source. Losing it means rebuilding it by hand.
/output/*
!/output/pdf/
/output/pdf/*
!/output/pdf/*.pdf
!/output/presentation/
/output/presentation/*
!/output/presentation/*.pptx
